  data: {
    LLM: 'Memory is key. Remember which cards are in your other books so when a useful card appears in the Pond, you know exactly which book to pick up.\n\nBlocking: If you see your opponent is hoarding 7s, keep a 7 in your current book to prevent them from finishing their set.\n\nDual-Processing: Skilled players can track the contents of 2-3 books simultaneously, swapping cards in rapid succession between the Pond and their books with almost no pause.',
    Player: 'Memory is key. Remember which cards are in your other books so when a useful card appears in the Pond, you know exactly which book to pick up.\n\nBlocking: If you see your opponent is hoarding 7s, keep a 7 in your current book to prevent them from finishing their set.\n\nDual-Processing: Skilled players can track the contents of 2-3 books simultaneously, swapping cards in rapid succession between the Pond and their books with almost no pause.',
